/S /H2
/T (Some vitamins, herbs, and natural medicines are not safe during pregnancy. Please be sure to ask your provider before taking these substances.)
/E (Some vitamins, herbs, and natural medicines are not safe during pregnancy. Please be sure to ask your provider before taking these substances.)
/Pg 19 0 R
