837 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (MAY I CONTINUE TO HAVE SEX?)
/E (MAY I CONTINUE TO HAVE SEX?)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
838 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Yes. Under most circumstances, there is no reason to stop having sex. If you have any concerns about having sex during pregnancy, please talk with your obstetric provider. If you have vaginal bleeding after sex \(or at any other time during pregnancy\), please contact your provider.)
/E (Yes. Under most circumstances, there is no reason to stop having sex. If you have any concerns about having sex during pregnancy, please talk with your obstetric provider. If you have vaginal bleeding after sex \(or at any other time during pregnancy\), please contact your provider.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
839 0 obj
<<
