/P 363 0 R
/Pg 25 0 R
>>
endobj
1009 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Now you need to practice contracting these muscles. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
1010 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Contract slowly for a count of 10, or 15 if you can. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
1011 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Then, as you release the contraction, again count )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
1012 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (slowly to 10 or 15. That is one exercise.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
